2. SECURITY POLICIES AND RESTRICTIONS
-------------------------------------

The User acknowledges that the Software enforces strict security policies:

2.1. SCRIPT EXECUTION BLOCKING
   - All script files (.ps1, .bat, .cmd, .js, .vbs, etc.) are blocked
   - Script interpreters (PowerShell, CMD, WScript, etc.) are restricted
   - No script execution is permitted within the ecosystem

2.2. CODE INJECTION PREVENTION
   - Runtime code injection is blocked
   - DLL injection is prevented
   - Memory manipulation is restricted

2.3. FILE SYSTEM CONTROL
   - Only authorized file formats are allowed
   - File creation and modification are monitored
   - Suspicious files are automatically quarantined

2.4. REGISTRY PROTECTION
   - Critical registry keys are protected
   - Unauthorized registry modifications are blocked
   - System configuration changes are restricted

